  "verification": "Every batch read through expected_identity/read_result (identity + SHA256) and its receipt SHA256 recomputed from the file; kerma/h10 finite and non-negative; the raw per-voxel sums and the hit counts reproduce dose.npz exactly (assert_array_equal); dose.npz n_batches == 20.",
  "limitations": "Per-voxel batch values and cross-voxel batch covariance are not kept: with 83% of the 1137600 voxels hit, a per-voxel table would be larger than the raw files and would duplicate data. dose.npz retains the per-voxel batch sums (kerma_keV, h10_track_pSv_cm3), mean, SEM, relative error and n_batches_hit for the full grid, so per-voxel first and second moments stay recoverable; what is lost is the per-voxel batch time series, hence any re-analysis over a subset of batches. Voxel size 5.0 cm. No Drive copy.",
  "deletion_status": "moved to ~/.Trash/jsmp133_raw_batches_2026-11-08/ivr_room_box_colab_results",
